 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the figure showing Graphs <i>S</i>, <i>T</i>, <i>U</i>, <i>V</i>, and <i>W</i>.\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"exercises/media/0f8a985fb2c83b4d.png\" alt=\"Five graphs are labeled graph S, graph T, graph U, graph V, and graph W. Graph S has five vertices: a, b, c, d, and e. The edges connect a b, a c, b c, c d, c e, and d e. Graph T has four vertices: a, b, d, and e. The edges connect a b, a e, b d, and d e. Graph U has 6 vertices: a, b, f, c, d, and e. The vertices connect a b, a f, f d, b c, c d, d e, c e, and a c. Graph V has four vertices: a, b, d, and e. The edges connect a b, a d, a e, b d, and d e. Graph W has four vertices: a, b, d, and e. The edges connect a b, a d, and d e.\">\n\n",
